      "side": 1,
      "message": "RW_FWID address must be set to `0x40144`, because that address is hardcoded in RO. This is related to [this comment](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/5018794/comment/ad298c0e_0b0bba7d)\n\n```\ndump_fmap -h helipilot_v2.0.24337-2726e9f149-RO_v2.0.26878-c9a5670643-RW.bin \n# name                     start       end         size\nEC_RW                      00040000    00090000    00050000\n  SIG_RW                     0008fc00    00090000    00000400\n  RW_RBVER                   00040168    0004016c    00000004\n  RW_FWID                    00040144    00040164    00000020\nWP_RO                      00000000    00020000    00020000\n  EC_RO                      00000000    0001f040    0001f040\n    FR_MAIN                    00000040    0001f040    0001f000\n      KEY_RO                     0001ec40    0001f040    00000400\n      FMAP                       0000d500    0000d6dc    000001dc\n      RO_FRID                    00000184    000001a4    00000020\n```",
      "range": {
