      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T13:55:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In other comment I meant that `spip0` node could be splitted into two parts: One part that defines SPI pins and the other part with definition of the sensor.\n\nSPI pins should be in `soc.dtsi` file, sensor definitions (highlited code by this comment) should be moved to `helipilot.dts` file.\n\nSensor definition alone will look like this:\n```\n\u0026spip0 {\n\tfp_sensor: fpc1025@0 {\n\t\tcompatible \u003d \"fpc,fpc1025\";\n\t\treg \u003d \u003c0\u003e;\n\t\tspi-max-frequency \u003d \u003c4000000\u003e;\n\n\t\twidth \u003d \u003c160\u003e;\n\t\theight \u003d \u003c160\u003e;\n\t\tbits-per-pixel \u003d \u003c8\u003e;\n\t\tv4l2-pixel-format \u003d \"V4L2_PIX_FMT_GREY\";\n\n\t\tirq-gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiob 0 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH\u003e;\n\t\treset-gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpio9 6 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW\u003e;\n\t};\n};\n```",
      "range": {
